@startuml
' drevops/behat-steps - data flow for generating the reference documentation.
' Traced from docs.php constants STEPS_DIRECTORY, TOOLBOX_CLASSES,
' HELPERS_FILE, CONFIGURATION_FILE and functions main, collect_step_traits,
' extract_info, extract_helpers, collect_helper_methods, file_declares_trait,
' parse_class_comment, parse_method_comment, extract_method_steps,
' resolve_inherited_comment, validate, validate_helpers, validate_tags,
' validate_env_vars, tag_registry, render_info, render_helpers,
' render_extension_options, render_tag_reference, replace_content.
' Regenerate every SVG with:  plantuml -tsvg docs/architecture/*.puml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
title Data flow: reference documentation generation

participant "ahoy update-docs\nahoy lint-docs" as Dev
participant "docs.php main()" as Main
participant "collect_step_traits()" as Collect
participant "Test FeatureContext" as Ctx
participant "extract_info()\nextract_helpers()" as Extract
participant "validate()\nvalidate_helpers()\nvalidate_tags()\nvalidate_env_vars()" as Validate
participant "render_info()\nrender_helpers()\nrender_extension_options()\nrender_tag_reference()" as Render

Dev -> Main: php docs.php [~--fail-on-change]
activate Main
Main -> Main: require build/vendor/autoload.php\nand the FeatureContext bootstrap

Main -> Collect: collect_step_traits(FeatureContext::class)
activate Collect
Collect -> Ctx: ReflectionClass::getTraits()
activate Ctx
Ctx --> Collect: every composed trait
deactivate Ctx
Collect -> Collect: scan src/Steps/<context>/ for files\nthat declare a trait, and match them off
Collect -> Collect: derive Generic or Drupal\nfrom the src/Steps subdirectory

alt a trait file was never composed in
  Collect -> Main: throw Exception(not found in the class)
end
Collect --> Main: trait reflections and contexts
deactivate Collect

Main -> Extract: read the members off each trait
activate Extract
Extract -> Extract: vocabulary: methods prefixed with the\ntrait name that carry a step attribute
Extract -> Extract: toolbox: the rest, minus hooks,\ntransformations and anything @internal
Extract -> Extract: add the classes listed in TOOLBOX_CLASSES
Extract -> Extract: parse each docblock for the description\nand the @code example, following\n{@inheritdoc} to its declaration
Extract --> Main: step info and helper info
deactivate Extract

Main -> Validate: validate the vocabulary, the toolbox,\nthe tags and the environment
activate Validate
note right of Validate
  When needs "I ", Then needs "should"
  and an Assert method name, one step
  attribute per method, an example is
  mandatory, every published helper needs
  a summary, tags must match tag_registry(),
  every getenv() name must be documented
end note
alt errors found
  Validate --> Main: error list
  Main --> Dev: print errors, exit 1
else clean
  Validate --> Main: no errors
end
deactivate Validate

Main -> Render: render every target
activate Render
Render -> Render: build the option table from the\nBehatStepsExtension config tree\nand the tag table from tag_registry()
Render -> Render: swap each block between its\nstart marker and its end marker
Render --> Main: STEPS.md, README.md, HELPERS.md\nand docs/configuration.md contents
deactivate Render

alt every target is unchanged
  Main --> Dev: exit 0, documentation is up to date
else a target differs, with ~--fail-on-change
  Main --> Dev: exit 1, naming the outdated targets, nothing written
else a target differs, update mode
  Main --> Dev: write only the targets that changed
end
deactivate Main
@enduml
